<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="th">
<head>
    <%- include('../../partials/script') %>
    <style>
        .custom-scrollbar::-webkit-scrollbar {
            width: 6px;
            height: 6px;
        }
        .custom-scrollbar::-webkit-scrollbar-track {
            background: #f1f5f9;
        }
        .custom-scrollbar::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
            background: #cbd5e1;
            border-radius: 4px;
        }
        .custom-scrollbar::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover {
            background: #94a3b8;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="bg-slate-50 text-slate-800 antialiased font-sans">
    <%- include('../../partials/header') %>

    <div id="vue-app" class="w-full px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-5 pb-28" v-cloak>
        
        <!-- Header -->
        <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row lg:items-center lg:justify-between gap-4 mb-6 pb-4 border-b border-slate-200">
            <div>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                    <span class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-600 to-indigo-600 flex items-center justify-center text-white text-xl shadow-md">
                        🔄
                    </span>
                    <div>
                        <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2">
                            FCA Flex Shipment Integration Architecture
                            <span class="text-xs bg-purple-100 text-purple-800 font-semibold px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full border border-purple-300">
                                Vue2-flow Architecture Spec
                            </span>
                        </h1>
                        <p class="text-slate-550 text-xs mt-0.5">
                            ผังโครงสร้างการทำงานแบบโต้ตอบ (Interactive Flow), การเชื่อมโยงตารางฐานข้อมูล และข้อกำหนดรูปแบบไฟล์ 25 คอลัมน์
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Navigation Links -->
            <div class="flex items-center flex-wrap gap-2 text-xs">
                <a href="/debug-fca" class="bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-700 text-white font-medium px-3.5 py-2 rounded-lg shadow-sm transition flex items-center gap-1.5">
                    <span>⚡</span> เปิด Vue2-flow Debugger
                </a>
                <a href="/debug-fca-advanced" class="bg-white hover:bg-slate-100 text-slate-700 font-medium px-3 py-2 rounded-lg border border-slate-300 shadow-sm transition flex items-center gap-1.5">
                    <span>📊</span> โหมด Batch Analysis
                </a>
                <a href="/main_menu" class="bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-900 text-white font-medium px-3.5 py-2 rounded-lg shadow-sm transition flex items-center gap-1.5">
                    ← เมนูหลัก
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Key Differences Banner -->
        <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-900 via-indigo-900 to-slate-900 text-white p-5 lg:p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-md mb-6">
            <h2 class="text-sm font-bold text-purple-200 mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
                <span>💡</span> ข้อแตกต่างสำคัญระหว่างระบบ FCA (Flex) และ ACA (Carriage):
            </h2>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 text-xs">
                <div class="bg-white/10 p-3.5 rounded-xl border border-white/10">
                    <span class="font-bold text-amber-300 block mb-1">1. การเชื่อมต่อฐานข้อมูลผลิต</span>
                    <p class="text-purple-100 leading-relaxed">
                        FCA เชื่อมต่อฐานข้อมูล <code>SGFCDB02/HITACHI02</code> (ตาราง <code>PROD_DATA</code> และ <code>PACK_HEADER</code>) โดยตรงด้วยรหัส <code>prod_lot</code> ไม่ต้องแปลงผ่านตาราง FGREC Box/Pack แบบ ACA
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="bg-white/10 p-3.5 rounded-xl border border-white/10">
                    <span class="font-bold text-amber-300 block mb-1">2. คอลัมน์ Build Name & Remark</span>
                    <p class="text-purple-100 leading-relaxed">
                        FCA ดึงค่าจาก <code>WMS.HIT_FGREC_DATA.remark</code> ไประบุในคอลัมน์ Build Name ส่วนคอลัมน์ Remark และ วันหมดอายุ (Expiry Date) ถูกปล่อยเป็นค่าว่าง
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="bg-white/10 p-3.5 rounded-xl border border-white/10">
                    <span class="font-bold text-amber-300 block mb-1">3. SFTP Account & Prefix</span>
                    <p class="text-purple-100 leading-relaxed">
                        FCA ใช้ Account <code>Belton</code> และคีย์ <code>Belton.ppk</code> โดยในโค้ดจะส่งเฉพาะ BPI Direct (รหัสไฟล์ S0005/Z0005) ส่วน PRB ถูกระงับการทำงานไว้ในสคริปต์
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Main Interactive Vue2-flow Canvas Section -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-6 mb-8">
            
            <!-- Left 8 Cols: Vue2-flow Interactive Canvas -->
            <div class="lg:col-span-8 flex flex-col">
                <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm p-4 flex-grow flex flex-col">
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-3 pb-2 border-b border-slate-150">
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                            <h2 class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-800 flex items-center gap-1.5">
                                <span>🗺️</span> FCA Pipeline Specification (Vue2-flow Interactive Map)
                            </h2>
                            <span class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 hidden sm:inline">(คลิกที่โหนดเพื่อดูคำสั่ง SQL, ความสัมพันธ์ของตาราง และรายละเอียด)</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                            <button @click="resetFlowPositions" title="จัดตำแหน่งเริ่มต้น" class="text-xs text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-800 font-medium px-2.5 py-1 bg-slate-100 rounded-lg hover:bg-slate-200 transition">
                                ↺ จัดผังใหม่
                            </button>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Vue2-flow Canvas -->
                    <div class="relative w-full h-[580px] flex-grow rounded-xl overflow-hidden">
                        <v-flow 
                            ref="vflow"
                            :nodes="flowNodes" 
                            :conns="flowConns"
                            :selected-node-id="selectedNodeId"
                            :grid="true"
                            :zoomable="true"
                            :pannable="true"
                            :draggable="true"
                            @node-click="onNodeClick"
                        >
                            <!-- Custom Node Slot Template -->
                            <template slot="node" slot-scope="{ node, selected }">
                                <div 
                                    :class="[
                                        'rounded-xl border p-3 bg-white shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-200 flex flex-col justify-between cursor-pointer select-none',
                                        selected ? 'border-indigo-600 ring-4 ring-indigo-100 shadow-md' : 'border-slate-200 hover:border-slate-400'
                                    ]"
                                    :style="{ width: (node.width || 250) + 'px', minHeight: (node.height || 110) + 'px' }"
                                >
                                    <!-- Node Header -->
                                    <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-1.5 mb-1.5">
                                        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 min-w-0 flex-1">
                                            <div 
                                                class="w-7 h-7 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-bold shrink-0 shadow-xs"
                                                :style="{ backgroundColor: node.iconBg || '#f1f5f9', color: node.iconColor || '#334155' }"
                                            >
                                                {{ node.icon || '📌' }}
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
                                                <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 flex-wrap">
                                                    <div class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-800 leading-tight">
                                                        {{ node.name }}
                                                    </div>
                                                    <span 
                                                        v-if="node.isCustom" 
                                                        title="ขั้นตอนนี้ถูกเพิ่มเติมนอกเหนือจาก Flow ปกติของ Source Code"
                                                        class="text-[7.5px] font-extrabold px-1.5 py-0.2 rounded-full bg-purple-100 text-purple-700 border border-purple-300 shrink-0 font-mono tracking-tight flex items-center gap-0.5"
                                                    >
                                                        <span>✨</span>CUSTOM
                                                    </span>
                                                </div>
                                                <div class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 truncate mt-0.5 font-mono">
                                                    {{ node.tableName }}
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>

                                        <!-- Step Badge -->
                                        <span class="text-[9px] font-bold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full border bg-purple-50 text-purple-700 border-purple-200 shrink-0">
                                            Step {{ node.stepNum }}
                                        </span>
                                    </div>

                                    <!-- Node Footer / Details Preview -->
                                    <div class="text-[10px] text-slate-600 bg-slate-50 rounded-lg px-2 py-1 border border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-between mt-auto font-mono">
                                        <span class="text-slate-500 truncate max-w-[150px]">{{ node.funPhp || node.sublabel }}</span>
                                        <span class="text-indigo-600 text-[10px] font-bold">🔍 ดูสเปก</span>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </template>
                        </v-flow>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Right 4 Cols: Step Specification Drawer Panel -->
            <div class="lg:col-span-4 flex flex-col">
                <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm p-4 lg:p-5 flex-grow flex flex-col max-h-[650px] overflow-y-auto custom-scrollbar">
                    
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-3 mb-4 border-b border-slate-150">
                        <h2 class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-800 flex items-center gap-2">
                            <span>📖</span> Step Specification (ข้อกำหนด)
                        </h2>
                        <span v-if="activeStep" class="text-xs font-mono bg-purple-100 text-purple-800 font-bold px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-lg border border-purple-200">
                            Step {{ activeStep.stepNum }}
                        </span>
                    </div>

                    <!-- When a step is selected -->
                    <div v-if="activeStep" class="space-y-4 text-xs">
                        
                        <!-- Step Title & Description -->
                        <div>
                            <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-1">
                                <div class="flex items-center gap-2 flex-wrap min-w-0">
                                    <span class="font-bold text-slate-800 text-sm flex items-center gap-1.5">
                                        <span>{{ activeStep.icon }}</span> {{ activeStep.name }}
                                    </span>
                                    <span 
                                        v-if="activeStep.isCustom" 
                                        class="text-[9px] font-bold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md bg-purple-100 text-purple-700 border border-purple-300 flex items-center gap-1 shadow-2xs font-mono"
                                    >
                                        <span>✨</span> CUSTOM (เพิ่มเติมนอกเหนือจาก Flow ปกติ)
                                    </span>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <p class="text-slate-600 text-[11.5px] leading-relaxed mt-1">{{ activeStep.description }}</p>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Database & PHP Function Info -->
                        <div class="bg-slate-50 p-3 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 space-y-1.5 font-mono text-[11px]">
                            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                                <span class="text-slate-500 font-bold">Database:</span>
                                <span class="text-slate-800 font-semibold bg-white px-2 py-0.5 rounded border border-slate-200">{{ activeStep.database }}</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                                <span class="text-slate-500 font-bold">Primary Table:</span>
                                <span class="text-indigo-700 font-semibold">{{ activeStep.tableName }}</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                                <span class="text-slate-500 font-bold">Legacy Function:</span>
                                <span class="text-emerald-700 font-semibold">{{ activeStep.funPhp }}</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Key Table Relationships & Fields -->
                        <div>
                            <span class="font-bold text-slate-700 flex items-center gap-1 mb-1.5">
                                <span>🔗</span> ตารางและฟิลด์ที่เกี่ยวข้อง:
                            </span>
                            <div class="bg-slate-50 p-3 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 space-y-1.5 text-[11px]">
                                <div v-for="(item, idx) in activeStep.fields" :key="idx" class="flex items-start gap-2">
                                    <span class="text-indigo-500">•</span>
                                    <div>
                                        <code class="font-bold text-indigo-700 bg-white px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded border border-slate-200 text-[10.5px]">{{ item.field }}</code>:
                                        <span class="text-slate-600">{{ item.desc }}</span>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- RAW SQL Template -->
                        <div v-if="activeStep.sql">
                            <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-1.5">
                                <span class="font-bold text-slate-700 flex items-center gap-1">
                                    <span>⚙️</span> SQL Query Template:
                                </span>
                                <button 
                                    @click="copyText(activeStep.sql)"
                                    class="bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-white text-[10px] px-2 py-0.5 rounded transition font-mono"
                                >
                                    คัดลอก SQL
                                </button>
                            </div>
                            <pre class="bg-slate-900 text-emerald-400 p-3 rounded-xl font-mono text-[10.5px] overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre-wrap max-h-40 custom-scrollbar border border-slate-800 select-all">{{ activeStep.sql }}</pre>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Business Rule / Note Alert -->
                        <div class="bg-purple-50 text-purple-900 p-3 rounded-xl border border-purple-200 text-[11px] leading-relaxed">
                            <span class="font-bold block mb-0.5">📌 Business Rule:</span>
                            {{ activeStep.rule }}
                        </div>

                    </div>

                    <!-- Empty state -->
                    <div v-else class="flex-grow flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center p-6 text-slate-400">
                        <span class="text-4xl mb-2">👆</span>
                        <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-600">คลิกที่โหนดบน Flowchart</span>
                        <span class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 mt-1">เพื่อเปิดดูรายละเอียดและคำสั่ง SQL ของแต่ละขั้นตอน</span>
                    </div>

                </div>
            </div>

        </div>

        <!-- 25 Columns Specification Table -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm p-5">
            <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between gap-3 mb-4">
                <div>
                    <h2 class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-800 flex items-center gap-2">
                        <span>📋</span> ตารางข้อกำหนด 25 คอลัมน์ในไฟล์ CSV (FCA Flex Output Format)
                    </h2>
                    <p class="text-slate-500 text-xs mt-0.5">
                        โครงสร้างมาตรฐานไฟล์ CSV ที่ถูกส่งมอบเข้า SFTP ของทาง Western Digital
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-500 bg-slate-100 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-200">
                    Format: <span class="text-emerald-700 font-bold">{Prefix}_{Type}_{Date}_000000_BEL_FLEX_{Model}_{Running}.csv</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="overflow-x-auto border border-slate-200 rounded-xl custom-scrollbar">
                <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse text-xs">
                    <thead class="bg-slate-800 text-white text-[11px]">
                        <tr>
                            <th class="px-4 py-2.5 font-medium border-r border-slate-700">ลำดับ</th>
                            <th class="px-4 py-2.5 font-medium border-r border-slate-700">ชื่อหัวข้อคอลัมน์ (Header)</th>
                            <th class="px-4 py-2.5 font-medium border-r border-slate-700">แหล่งที่มาข้อมูลในโปรแกรม (Data Source / Logic)</th>
                            <th class="px-4 py-2.5 font-medium">ตัวอย่างค่า</th>
                        </tr>
                    </thead>
                    <tbody class="divide-y divide-slate-100 font-mono text-[11px]">
                        <tr class="hover:bg-slate-50"><td class="px-4 py-2 text-slate-400 border-r border-slate-100">1</td><td class="px-4 py-2 font-bold text-slate-800 border-r border-slate-100">SupplierName</td><td class="px-4 py-2 text-slate-600 border-r border-slate-100 font-sans">ค่าคงที่ <code>'Belton'</code></td><td class="px-4 py-2 text-slate-500">Belton</td></tr>
                        <tr class="hover:bg-slate-50"><td class="px-4 py-2 text-slate-400 border-r border-slate-100">2</td><td class="px-4 py-2 font-bold text-slate-800 border-r border-slate-100">PartName</td><td class="px-4 py-2 text-slate-600 border-r border-slate-100 font-sans">ค่าคงที่ <code>'FCA'</code></td><td class="px-4 py-2 text-slate-500">FCA</td></tr>
                        <tr class="hover:bg-slate-50"><td class="px-4 py-2 text-slate-400 border-r border-slate-100">3</td><td class="px-4 py-2 font-bold text-slate-800 border-r border-slate-100">SHIPDATE</td><td class="px-4 py-2 text-slate-600 border-r border-slate-100 font-sans">วันที่จาก <code>WMS.HIT_SHIP_CONFIRM</code> (ฟอร์แมต <code>d-M-Y</code>)</td><td class="px-4 py-2 text-blue-700 font-semibold">18-August-2026</td></tr>
                        <tr class="hover:bg-slate-50"><td class="px-4 py-2 text-slate-400 border-r border-slate-100">4</td><td class="px-4 py-2 font-bold text-emerald-700 border-r border-slate-100">INVNUM</td><td class="px-4 py-2 text-slate-600 border-r border-slate-100 font-sans">หมายเลข DO (DO Number)</td><td class="px-4 py-2 text-emerald-700 font-bold">HGBC2608034</td></tr>
                        <tr class="hover:bg-slate-50"><td class="px-4 py-2 text-slate-400 border-r border-slate-100">5</td><td class="px-4 py-2 font-bold text-slate-800 border-r border-slate-100">Transfer Order</td><td class="px-4 py-2 text-slate-600 border-r border-slate-100 font-sans">หมายเลข PO (<code>WMS.SHIPMENTPLAN_DATA.po_no</code>)</td><td class="px-4 py-2 text-slate-700">PO-45001234</td></tr>
                        <tr class="hover:bg-slate-50"><td class="px-4 py-2 text-slate-400 border-r border-slate-100">6</td><td class="px-4 py-2 font-bold text-slate-800 border-r border-slate-100">PARTNUMBER</td><td class="px-4 py-2 text-slate-600 border-r border-slate-100 font-sans">Customer PN (<code>WMS.SHIPMENTPLAN_DATA.customer_pn</code>)</td><td class="px-4 py-2 text-slate-700">0B32145</td></tr>
                        <tr class="hover:bg-slate-50"><td class="px-4 py-2 text-slate-400 border-r border-slate-100">7</td><td class="px-4 py-2 font-bold text-slate-800 border-r border-slate-100">Pallet Number</td><td class="px-4 py-2 text-slate-600 border-r border-slate-100 font-sans">หมายเลขพาเลท (<code>WMS.HIT_SHIP_CONFIRM.pallet_no</code>)</td><td class="px-4 py-2 text-slate-700">FCAVFA826081701</td></tr>
                        <tr class="hover:bg-slate-50"><td class="px-4 py-2 text-slate-400 border-r border-slate-100">8</td><td class="px-4 py-2 font-bold text-indigo-700 border-r border-slate-100">MODEL</td><td class="px-4 py-2 text-slate-600 border-r border-slate-100 font-sans">ชื่อรุ่นผลิตภัณฑ์ (<code>WMS.SHIPMENTPLAN_DATA.model_name</code>)</td><td class="px-4 py-2 text-indigo-700 font-bold">CARA_2_4_2D</td></tr>
                        <tr class="hover:bg-slate-50"><td class="px-4 py-2 text-slate-400 border-r border-slate-100">9</td><td class="px-4 py-2 font-bold text-slate-800 border-r border-slate-100">Plt</td><td class="px-4 py-2 text-slate-600 border-r border-slate-100 font-sans">ค่าคงที่ <code>'1'</code></td><td class="px-4 py-2 text-slate-500">1</td></tr>
                        <tr class="hover:bg-slate-50"><td class="px-4 py-2 text-slate-400 border-r border-slate-100">10</td><td class="px-4 py-2 font-bold text-slate-800 border-r border-slate-100">QTY</td><td class="px-4 py-2 text-slate-600 border-r border-slate-100 font-sans">จำนวนรวมบนพาเลท (<code>WMS.HIT_PALLET_DATA.qty_pallet</code>)</td><td class="px-4 py-2 text-slate-800 font-semibold">10800</td></tr>
                        <tr class="hover:bg-slate-50"><td class="px-4 py-2 text-slate-400 border-r border-slate-100">11</td><td class="px-4 py-2 font-bold text-slate-800 border-r border-slate-100">SUBINVENTORY</td><td class="px-4 py-2 text-slate-600 border-r border-slate-100 font-sans"><code>'RMCOI-T2'</code> สำหรับ Direct, ค่าว่างสำหรับ Hub</td><td class="px-4 py-2 text-slate-500">RMCOI-T2 / -</td></tr>
                        <tr class="hover:bg-slate-50"><td class="px-4 py-2 text-slate-400 border-r border-slate-100">12</td><td class="px-4 py-2 font-bold text-emerald-700 border-r border-slate-100">Build Name</td><td class="px-4 py-2 text-slate-600 border-r border-slate-100 font-sans">หมายเหตุรุ่นจาก <code>WMS.HIT_FGREC_DATA.remark</code></td><td class="px-4 py-2 text-emerald-700 font-semibold">FLEX_BUILD_REV2</td></tr>
                        <tr class="hover:bg-slate-50"><td class="px-4 py-2 text-slate-400 border-r border-slate-100">13-15</td><td class="px-4 py-2 font-bold text-slate-800 border-r border-slate-100">ETA, Time, shipper</td><td class="px-4 py-2 text-slate-600 border-r border-slate-100 font-sans">ค่าว่าง (<code>''</code>)</td><td class="px-4 py-2 text-slate-400">-</td></tr>
